{"4988040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Combo Break", "steam_appid": 4988040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4991740], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/8420e35ff63a6e79ae8d790f343026ff.poster.avif?t=1787417623\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/8420e35ff63a6e79ae8d790f343026ff.webm?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/8420e35ff63a6e79ae8d790f343026ff.mp4?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br><br>Combo Break</strong> blends the satisfying chaos of a bouncing-ball peg machine with the depth of roguelite deckbuilding. Fill your board with special pegs, combine their effects into powerful synergies, and chase the perfect run where every bounce triggers a cascade. It's a nonstop dopamine rush wrapped in one unpredictable, combo-stacking ride.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/a924ffb9ef51d6f626ccd6a02681c299.poster.avif?t=1787417623\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/a924ffb9ef51d6f626ccd6a02681c299.webm?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/a924ffb9ef51d6f626ccd6a02681c299.mp4?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DROP PEGS. STACK EFFECTS. BREAK THE COMBO METER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your balls bounce on their own — the game is what you <i>build</i> for them to hit. Discover special pegs and slot them onto your board to trigger wild chain reactions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain</strong> pegs fire lightning between neighbors, hitting multiple pegs from a single bounce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jackpot</strong> pegs charge up and detonate into screen-filling gold payouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Burn</strong> pegs set the board alight, ticking damage over time on everything they touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splitter</strong> pegs spawn extra balls mid-run to flood the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnet</strong> pegs bend nearby balls into your best pegs for guaranteed hits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crit</strong>, <strong>Overdrive</strong>, <strong>Combo Hold</strong>, and <strong>Gamble</strong> pegs push your multiplier higher, faster, and riskier.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line them up right and one ball sets off a chain of chains — lightning, fire, and jackpots all going off at once as your combo meter blazes white-hot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/d391c5d42d80e8fb7bbce39eb61b5248.poster.avif?t=1787417623\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/d391c5d42d80e8fb7bbce39eb61b5248.webm?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/d391c5d42d80e8fb7bbce39eb61b5248.mp4?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A BOARD THAT'S ALL YOURS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 board formations</strong> — arc, grid, ring, spiral, star and more — each changing how your balls flow and where your combos ignite. Expand up to <strong>15 peg sockets</strong> and <strong>10 simultaneous balls</strong>, then pour points into a shared <strong>skill tree</strong> that reshapes your whole strategy. Every run is a fresh puzzle: what you draft, where you place it, and how the effects feed each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/6bd9793f6a67c472d3314fdc4523e2f5.poster.avif?t=1787417623\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/6bd9793f6a67c472d3314fdc4523e2f5.webm?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/6bd9793f6a67c472d3314fdc4523e2f5.mp4?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO WAYS TO PLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless</strong> — free-play sandbox. Build forever, chase your biggest board, and see how absurd the payouts can get.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive</strong> — a survival gauntlet against a rising score clock. Hit each checkpoint before time runs out, climb as far as you can, and post your score to the <strong>global leaderboard.</strong> Every second counts, and one weak stretch ends the run.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/9abdaf20f0ba90adff15141836524d20.poster.avif?t=1787417623\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/9abdaf20f0ba90adff15141836524d20.webm?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/9abdaf20f0ba90adff15141836524d20.mp4?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>11 special peg effects</strong> that stack into explosive synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 board formations</strong> that reshape how every run plays</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to <strong>15 sockets and 10 balls</strong> on a single board</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>shared skill tree</strong> for run-defining upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless mode</strong> for infinite, no-pressure building</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Competitive mode</strong> with survival checkpoints and a <strong>global leaderboard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep, escalating <strong>combo system</strong> — the better your board, the louder it gets</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/24eebdb0f0acfef6cedae2da212e8c6a.poster.avif?t=1787417623\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/24eebdb0f0acfef6cedae2da212e8c6a.webm?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/24eebdb0f0acfef6cedae2da212e8c6a.mp4?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/8420e35ff63a6e79ae8d790f343026ff.poster.avif?t=1787417623\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/8420e35ff63a6e79ae8d790f343026ff.webm?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/8420e35ff63a6e79ae8d790f343026ff.mp4?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><br><br>Combo Break</strong> blends the satisfying chaos of a bouncing-ball peg machine with the depth of roguelite deckbuilding. Fill your board with special pegs, combine their effects into powerful synergies, and chase the perfect run where every bounce triggers a cascade. It's a nonstop dopamine rush wrapped in one unpredictable, combo-stacking ride.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/a924ffb9ef51d6f626ccd6a02681c299.poster.avif?t=1787417623\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/a924ffb9ef51d6f626ccd6a02681c299.webm?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/a924ffb9ef51d6f626ccd6a02681c299.mp4?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DROP PEGS. STACK EFFECTS. BREAK THE COMBO METER.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your balls bounce on their own — the game is what you <i>build</i> for them to hit. Discover special pegs and slot them onto your board to trigger wild chain reactions:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chain</strong> pegs fire lightning between neighbors, hitting multiple pegs from a single bounce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jackpot</strong> pegs charge up and detonate into screen-filling gold payouts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Burn</strong> pegs set the board alight, ticking damage over time on everything they touch.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Splitter</strong> pegs spawn extra balls mid-run to flood the board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnet</strong> pegs bend nearby balls into your best pegs for guaranteed hits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crit</strong>, <strong>Overdrive</strong>, <strong>Combo Hold</strong>, and <strong>Gamble</strong> pegs push your multiplier higher, faster, and riskier.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Line them up right and one ball sets off a chain of chains — lightning, fire, and jackpots all going off at once as your combo meter blazes white-hot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/d391c5d42d80e8fb7bbce39eb61b5248.poster.avif?t=1787417623\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/d391c5d42d80e8fb7bbce39eb61b5248.webm?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4988040/extras/d391c5d42d80e8fb7bbce39eb61b5248.mp4?t=1787417623\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD A BOARD THAT'S ALL YOURS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from <strong>8 board formations</strong> — arc, grid, ring, spiral, star and more — each changing how your balls flow and where your combos ignite. Expand up to <strong>15 peg sockets</strong> and <strong>10 simultaneous balls</strong>, then pour points into a shared <strong>skill tree</strong> that reshapes your whole strategy. Every run is a fresh puzzle: what you draft, where you place it, and how the effects feed each other.</p><p class=\"